    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO MY ADVENTURE BOOK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before us are the exciting adventures of Jack, who went to the library and discovered a magic book. Having opened it, he finds himself in a wonderful world where he has to solve riddles. Find objects, solve puzzles and help the local inhabitants of this world so that you can return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.poster.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.webm?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.mp4?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have added several visual styles for this game. You can switch from one style to another at any time and look at the game world with a new perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/81093150c6aa4553cd69f60094835242.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you liked the game and want to support our work financially.<br>This is a short video of a character with a cake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/295f43694722d02ddb65b85c15b9f9f6.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >My Adventure Book 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If enough funds come in, we will develop a continuation of My Adventure Book 2. Which is much larger, brighter and with more elaborate mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.poster.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.webm?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.mp4?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO MY ADVENTURE BOOK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before us are the exciting adventures of Jack, who went to the library and discovered a magic book. Having opened it, he finds himself in a wonderful world where he has to solve riddles. Find objects, solve puzzles and help the local inhabitants of this world so that you can return home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.poster.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.webm?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/55de9938eea20088cbb4878f3b7cee95.mp4?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have added several visual styles for this game. You can switch from one style to another at any time and look at the game world with a new perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/81093150c6aa4553cd69f60094835242.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=168 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you liked the game and want to support our work financially.<br>This is a short video of a character with a cake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/295f43694722d02ddb65b85c15b9f9f6.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >My Adventure Book 2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If enough funds come in, we will develop a continuation of My Adventure Book 2. Which is much larger, brighter and with more elaborate mini-games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.poster.avif?t=1754586016\" width=600 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.webm?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2825390/extras/01bd88176f6c83307ca316dd9de4e0ac.mp4?t=1754586016\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Join the amazing adventure! Explore a magical world, solve puzzles, find objects and help local creatures. You will complete this game in 5 minutes!",
